  "notes": "Orrery 0.15.5\n\nDueling\n- Negate: right-click a card on the field and pick Negate to grey it out and cross it out. It shows on both screens; Undo Negate clears it, and it clears by itself when the card leaves the field or is set face-down.\n- Four new drawn effects: a Fusion vortex (Polymerization, Dark Polymerization), Curse chains (Dragon's Anathema), Freeze and Quake.\n- Drawn effects now play for every print of a card, and for cards whose names have quotes, commas or a \"?\" in them (Spear the Gungnir, Lluvia, Xipe Totec, Erra's Light Lightning).\n\nEffects Gallery\n- The new effects are in, each tab shows its effects a page at a time, and playing one tells you which cards use it.\n\nFaster\n- The first start after an update opens straight away instead of pausing to sort every card's keywords.\n- Card art is found even when a file name's capitals don't match (Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight's alt art, and its Constellation Rare sleeve and avatar).",
